            </paragraph>
            <paragraph>Passwords alone are no longer enough. Exponential 6.0.15 lets every user sign in with a passkey stored on their phone or computer, or add a one-time code from an authenticator app.</paragraph>
            <section>
              <section>
                <header>Verify it's you</header>
                <paragraph>Before a sensitive change, such as a new password or email address, Exponential asks the user to confirm who they are again. A stolen session alone can no longer take over an account.</paragraph>
